WEBVTT

00:11.000 --> 00:12.710
This is how I'll become...

00:15.750 --> 00:17.460
This is how I'll become...

00:19.460 --> 00:21.040
...Supreme Commander.

00:21.580 --> 00:22.830
...a hero.

00:23.380 --> 00:25.000
This is my story!

01:56.330 --> 02:00.040
<b>Whirlwind, Himari, Roar</b>

01:57.960 --> 02:01.670
Your little slave
makes a mean cup of coffee.

02:03.790 --> 02:06.460
What are you doing here, Tenka?

02:06.460 --> 02:09.040
You received a memo from
the Supreme Commander, yes?

02:09.040 --> 02:12.420
Regarding the appearance
of those vicious humanoid Shuuki.

02:12.420 --> 02:15.380
In general, our squadrons
operate independently.

02:15.380 --> 02:17.830
But moving forward, the Demon
Defense Force is to be more cohesive.

02:17.830 --> 02:19.330
Oh yeah, that.

02:19.630 --> 02:22.290
I heard the 7th Squadron's
second-in-command fainted

02:22.290 --> 02:25.830
when she was attacked
by one of the humanoid Shuuki.

02:26.830 --> 02:28.790
How pathetic!

02:29.290 --> 02:31.920
You're determined to drag
the Azuma Family's reputation

02:31.920 --> 02:33.630
through the mud, aren't you, Himari?

02:33.630 --> 02:36.130
Give it up and come home already.

02:38.580 --> 02:41.790
To be fair, those Shuuki
aren't exactly weak.

02:41.790 --> 02:44.420
Seems the 3rd Squadron
had a run-in with them, too.

02:44.420 --> 02:47.130
Yes... Not once, but twice.

02:47.130 --> 02:50.420
I can see why cooperating with the
other squadrons would be important...

02:50.420 --> 02:54.000
We find your presence reassuring,
Commander Kyouka.

02:54.420 --> 02:58.210
But some of us are hesitant
to put our trust in your team.

02:58.500 --> 03:00.670
I won't name any names,

03:00.670 --> 03:04.040
but we're concerned that
they might slow us down.

03:08.710 --> 03:12.580
We need to assess the current capabilities
of each of our teams.

03:14.000 --> 03:17.330
How about we hold an intersquad
Mato exhibition match?

03:18.580 --> 03:19.460
Oh?

03:19.460 --> 03:20.670
Huh?

03:20.670 --> 03:22.630
Mato exhibition match...?

03:23.130 --> 03:25.250
What is this, a baseball league?

03:27.460 --> 03:29.630
An "exhibition match" is what we call

03:29.630 --> 03:32.630
a contest of strength and skill
between two squadrons.

03:32.630 --> 03:34.250
Makes sense...

03:34.250 --> 03:36.630
Does single combat sound acceptable?

03:36.630 --> 03:39.880
You've never been one to mince words,
have you, Kyou?

03:40.500 --> 03:41.580
Fine by me.

03:43.290 --> 03:45.670
We'll adjust our numbers accordingly.

03:45.670 --> 03:47.790
See you later, little slave.

03:52.540 --> 03:54.880
Commander, I have a request.

03:55.250 --> 03:57.500
Will you help me prepare for the match?

03:59.880 --> 04:02.000
It's going to be physically demanding.

04:02.000 --> 04:04.210
So long as I win,
I'll do whatever it takes!

04:04.210 --> 04:06.670
Then you'd better buckle down
and start training!

04:06.670 --> 04:07.750
Yes, ma'am!

04:11.380 --> 04:12.750
You heard the commander.

04:12.750 --> 04:16.670
I, Himari Azuma, claim you
as my slave from here on out!

04:16.670 --> 04:17.960
Huh...?

04:18.420 --> 04:19.920
BUT WHY?!

04:23.290 --> 04:25.830
This ramen broth tastes great!

04:26.670 --> 04:29.880
I always end up eating way too much
of Yukki's cooking!

04:29.880 --> 04:32.830
Did you use some sort
of secret ingredient?

04:32.830 --> 04:36.670
I wanted it to be rich and thick,
so I tried adding chicken fat!

04:36.670 --> 04:40.170
As far as housework goes,
your skills are perfect for a slave!

04:40.170 --> 04:44.290
Remind me again how I got
roped into being YOUR slave?

04:44.920 --> 04:47.540
It's for the sake of
the Mato exhibition match.

04:47.540 --> 04:49.960
I absolutely HAVE to win.

04:49.960 --> 04:52.460
But that doesn't explain
why I'm being forced to-

04:52.460 --> 04:55.080
We're keeping it simple this time
with single combat.

04:56.670 --> 04:59.670
Your sister's attitude struck a nerve,
didn't it, Himari?

04:59.670 --> 05:02.630
So use this match as an excuse
to kick her ass!

05:02.790 --> 05:05.210
Thank you for the chance
to do some ass-kicking!

05:05.210 --> 05:06.880
Ass-kicking is your sworn duty!

05:06.880 --> 05:08.630
Oh, I'll kick her ass alright!

05:08.630 --> 05:10.960
What's with all the kicking and asses?!

05:11.960 --> 05:16.540
You still haven't answered my question!
Why am I YOUR slave?!

05:16.540 --> 05:20.710
Transforming parts of my body
into weapons isn't my main ability.

05:20.710 --> 05:22.960
I only use it 'cause it's compatible.

05:23.710 --> 05:25.420
This is my real ability.

05:26.170 --> 05:30.880
<b>Character Info</b>

05:26.170 --> 05:30.880
<b>*Commander*</b>

05:26.170 --> 05:30.880
<b>Kyouka Uzen</b>

05:26.170 --> 05:30.880
<b>Mato Destruction Power</b>

05:26.380 --> 05:27.580
Miss Kyouka?

05:28.000 --> 05:29.250
It looks like some sort

05:29.250 --> 05:30.580
of trading card game...

05:32.670 --> 05:34.540
<b>LOFTY AMBITIONS: LEARNING</b>

05:32.920 --> 05:33.960
"Learning."

05:35.000 --> 05:38.170
I can learn other people's abilities
and use them for myself.

05:38.170 --> 05:39.750
That's my ability.

05:39.750 --> 05:41.580
Isn't that super OP?!

05:41.580 --> 05:45.290
I select someone's ability on my phone
and then implement it.

05:45.750 --> 05:48.750
Which means I can use
the commander's right now.

05:49.170 --> 05:52.830
You do understand what
Miss Kyouka's ability entails, right?

05:52.830 --> 05:55.540
I know, I know.
It's physically demanding.

05:55.540 --> 05:56.880
I got this!

05:57.080 --> 06:00.380
I don't mind taking over
the cleaning or the laundry

06:00.380 --> 06:02.960
if it means I get to kick Yachiho's ass!

06:08.330 --> 06:10.540
We're surrounded by Shuuki!
Hurry up!

06:10.540 --> 06:12.290
Fine, but I warned you!

06:22.920 --> 06:23.290
<b>WHIRL</b>

06:24.460 --> 06:24.830
<b>WIND</b>

06:26.580 --> 06:27.460
<b>ETERNAL CHAINS: SLAVE</b>

06:26.580 --> 06:27.460
<b>WHIRLWIND</b>

06:33.500 --> 06:36.250
You're a different shape than when
the commander does it...

06:42.790 --> 06:44.580
I can move with lightning speed!

06:44.580 --> 06:46.540
Even faster than with Miss Kyouka!

06:48.920 --> 06:51.670
But the drawback
is that I'm not as strong...

06:51.670 --> 06:52.960
Well, in that case...

06:57.130 --> 06:58.500
I'll just beat on 'em...

06:58.500 --> 07:00.000
till they drop!

07:01.000 --> 07:03.210
This is the key to fighting my sister!

07:07.670 --> 07:08.790
Good job!

07:08.790 --> 07:11.290
You could pick
from any number of abilities...

07:11.290 --> 07:13.500
Why do you insist on this one?

07:14.630 --> 07:17.630
It gives you a chance to be useful
even though you're a man.

07:17.630 --> 07:19.330
If anything, you ought to be grateful-

07:20.080 --> 07:22.630
Huh?! H-hold on...

07:22.630 --> 07:24.540
What's happening to me?!

07:24.540 --> 07:26.750
It's the price of her ability...

07:28.710 --> 07:32.040
S-so by "physically demanding,"
she meant...

07:32.460 --> 07:35.250
Wait, how come I can't move my body?!

07:35.250 --> 07:37.670
Because my reward isn't over yet,
I guess...

07:37.960 --> 07:41.290
Wh-why does it have to be THIS?!

07:41.830 --> 07:44.880
Speaking of which,
quit gawking at me already!

07:44.880 --> 07:47.380
But if I do that, you might-

07:47.380 --> 07:49.580
On second thought, just see for yourself.

07:55.380 --> 07:57.960
Am I going to be stuck like this forever?!

07:57.960 --> 07:59.080
Thought so.

07:59.290 --> 08:04.540
It's the price of her ability...
so it won't stop until I get my reward.

08:11.460 --> 08:12.290
Wha-?!

08:12.920 --> 08:15.420
Is this a sufficient reward for you?

08:19.500 --> 08:20.830
How indecent!

08:27.960 --> 08:30.880
You'd be better off
using a different ability.

08:30.880 --> 08:33.330
I would if I could, trust me!

08:33.580 --> 08:34.830
So shameful...

08:34.830 --> 08:36.670
Th-then why can't you?

08:37.790 --> 08:40.210
There's a compatibility component
to Learning.

08:40.210 --> 08:44.330
It degrades the quality of most abilities,
to the point that they become useless.

08:44.670 --> 08:48.130
For example, if I were to use
Shushu's Paradigm Shift,

08:44.670 --> 08:52.080
<b>Character Info</b>

08:44.670 --> 08:52.080
<b>*Fighter*</b>

08:44.670 --> 08:52.080
<b>Shushu Suruga</b>

08:44.670 --> 08:52.080
<b>Mato Destruction Power</b>

08:48.130 --> 08:51.250
all it would do is increase my bust size
by about three centimeters.

08:52.130 --> 08:54.750
But the price of Miss Kyouka's ability is-

08:54.750 --> 08:57.080
I'm aware of that, okay?!

08:59.080 --> 09:01.290
Why are you so desperate to win?

09:03.460 --> 09:05.420
I was born into the Azuma household,

09:05.420 --> 09:08.170
an influential family with
major accomplishments in Mato.

09:08.460 --> 09:12.960
My older sisters are successful,
so everyone had high hopes for me, too.

09:13.580 --> 09:16.580
But I'd overexert myself
before a big event and get hurt,

09:16.580 --> 09:20.210
or I'd get nervous and
come down with a fever.

09:20.210 --> 09:21.920
I never had results to show for it.

09:22.330 --> 09:24.460
Yeah, story of my life...

09:24.670 --> 09:26.500
Same with my Peach ability.

09:26.500 --> 09:29.420
I'm guessing they noticed
the problem you mentioned earlier.

09:30.960 --> 09:35.040
And 'cause of that, I'd always get teased
at home whenever I couldn't keep up.

09:35.500 --> 09:38.290
It must've been tough for you growing up.

09:39.130 --> 09:42.130
This is my first chance since
I cut ties with the Azuma Family

09:42.130 --> 09:44.330
to prove them wrong about me.

09:44.580 --> 09:47.790
So YOU are going to happily cooperate!

09:49.170 --> 09:53.580
It's REALLY hard to want to help someone
when they can't even ask politely.

09:54.040 --> 09:56.420
As for my ultimate goal...

09:57.630 --> 10:00.420
I want to be a hero like the commander.

10:00.420 --> 10:04.250
I feel like I'll become a new version
of myself if I can beat Yachiho.

10:04.250 --> 10:09.000
That part of me that nobody's ever seen
deserves a proper chance to shine!

10:09.000 --> 10:11.960
She's... just like me.

10:11.960 --> 10:15.380
Still, we're missing something
for the exhibition match.

10:15.380 --> 10:16.460
What's that?

10:16.710 --> 10:19.420
A finishing move
that will demolish our enemy.

10:19.710 --> 10:21.460
Oh yeah, come to think of it...

10:21.460 --> 10:25.130
all I've done so far is mindlessly
punch and kick everything in sight.

10:25.130 --> 10:28.630
I have my own reasons
for wanting to get stronger...

10:30.080 --> 10:33.250
Maybe she's the key
to opening up a new door!

10:33.540 --> 10:36.040
Even better if I manage
to help Miss Kyouka!

10:38.380 --> 10:40.540
Fine, fine. I'll do it.

10:40.540 --> 10:42.000
Watch your attitude.

10:42.000 --> 10:45.210
You're my slave, remember?
You don't have the right to refuse.

10:45.210 --> 10:46.210
Well?

10:46.210 --> 10:48.710
Our opponent, Yachiho Azuma,
what's her ability?

10:48.830 --> 10:54.420
<b>AZUMA TIME: GOLDEN HOUR</b>

10:49.040 --> 10:50.630
"Golden Hour."

10:50.630 --> 10:54.460
She can control time,
including freezing it and rewinding it.

10:54.960 --> 10:56.670
Welp, we're screwed!

10:58.670 --> 11:00.630
<b>6TH SQUADRON</b>

11:02.630 --> 11:04.790
My ears are burning...

11:04.790 --> 11:08.420
I have a sneaking suspicion
Himari's talking about me right now.

11:08.420 --> 11:11.210
She's such a worthless little sister!

11:11.210 --> 11:15.080
It's only right that she does my bidding
for the rest of her life.

11:16.790 --> 11:20.500
I'm going to put her in her place
at the Mato exhibition match...

11:22.000 --> 11:24.500
Oh, I can't wait for the big day!

11:28.080 --> 11:31.000
<b>Shio</b>

11:28.080 --> 11:31.000
<b>Ramen</b>

11:31.040 --> 11:33.580
Yachiho's ability is dangerous, for sure.

11:33.580 --> 11:34.880
But it takes power.

11:34.880 --> 11:37.380
She'll get tired if she uses it
too many times.

11:37.380 --> 11:39.330
And THAT'S how we'll win.

11:39.330 --> 11:42.500
The fact that she can use it
more than once makes things tricky.

11:42.500 --> 11:46.330
Also, she strikes a weird pose
to trigger her ability.

11:46.330 --> 11:48.960
Says it's a routine that
"enhances her skills."

11:50.080 --> 11:52.420
So we'll have to beat her to the punch.

11:52.420 --> 11:54.040
In that case, we ought to take advantage

11:54.040 --> 11:56.080
of my blistering speed
for our finishing move.

11:56.080 --> 11:57.170
Exactly.

11:57.170 --> 12:00.420
An ultra-fast maneuver that
won't even give her time to freeze time!

12:00.420 --> 12:03.130
And no leeway to rewind time, either.

12:03.130 --> 12:06.210
An attack with enough force
to knock her out of the fight completely!

12:06.210 --> 12:07.420
So like...

12:08.080 --> 12:10.920
a swift step forward
into a head-on punch!

12:10.920 --> 12:12.880
I think that'd be fastest.

12:12.880 --> 12:16.130
Let's work on polishing it into
a deadly blow that she can't dodge.

12:16.330 --> 12:19.830
Try channeling all your strength
into a single part of your body.

12:25.170 --> 12:26.290
Channel...

12:27.000 --> 12:28.500
all my strength...

12:28.500 --> 12:29.460
into my legs!

12:30.960 --> 12:32.790
Whoa, you actually did it!

12:34.710 --> 12:37.000
Just in time for our
practice dummies to arrive.

12:37.000 --> 12:38.210
Hell yeah!

12:40.000 --> 12:41.880
I'm even faster than before!

12:41.880 --> 12:42.830
At this rate...

12:43.540 --> 12:44.420
we're golden!

12:47.750 --> 12:49.540
Wait, why didn't it work?!

12:56.040 --> 12:57.420
Maybe I overdid it.

12:57.420 --> 12:59.000
My legs are exhausted...

12:59.000 --> 13:01.460
You probably lost
most of your arm strength

13:01.460 --> 13:04.420
because you poured all your energy
into your legs instead.

13:04.420 --> 13:07.750
We'll keep experimenting with it
until we perfect your technique.

13:08.040 --> 13:10.380
Uh, is this my reward?

13:16.040 --> 13:18.880
Wow, he does look different than with me.

13:18.880 --> 13:19.960
Commander!

13:19.960 --> 13:20.920
Miss Kyouka!

13:20.920 --> 13:21.920
Keep it up.

13:21.920 --> 13:22.750
Roger!

13:22.750 --> 13:23.630
Smart.

13:23.630 --> 13:27.580
Channeling his strength into a single
point to produce a more powerful effect...

13:27.830 --> 13:30.580
It's a proactive approach.
You've got a knack for this.

13:30.580 --> 13:32.420
Thanks, Commander!

13:32.420 --> 13:36.380
That being said, why are you watching him
from way back here?

13:36.380 --> 13:37.750
Well, I...

13:38.000 --> 13:41.580
You mustn't forget the fundamental essence
of my ability, Himari.

13:41.580 --> 13:42.880
Its essence?

13:45.880 --> 13:47.000
Make me proud.

13:48.790 --> 13:49.670
Hey!

13:49.670 --> 13:51.830
I'll be riding you
during the exhibition match.

13:51.830 --> 13:54.170
Let's do this like it's the real deal!

13:54.170 --> 13:56.710
This ability requires
dominating a slave...

13:56.710 --> 13:58.880
not just sitting back and coaching him.

13:59.170 --> 14:00.630
Get on top of the slave...

14:00.630 --> 14:02.330
seize the slave's chains...

14:02.330 --> 14:04.250
and issue a command as his master!

14:04.630 --> 14:06.920
Channel your strength into your legs!

14:09.080 --> 14:10.500
That's strange...

14:10.500 --> 14:13.000
I feel more power
flowing through me this time.

14:14.880 --> 14:16.250
Go crush that Shuuki!

14:29.210 --> 14:32.130
Did I really just do that?

14:32.420 --> 14:34.330
A foolproof finishing move!

14:35.500 --> 14:39.130
I got lost in the moment.
I'm not sure if I can replicate it...

14:39.130 --> 14:40.540
Oh, don't worry.

14:40.790 --> 14:43.500
Mato has plenty of
practice dummies for us!

14:47.500 --> 14:50.920
I'm a million times
more worn out than usual...

14:51.170 --> 14:53.670
Your technique lacks precision sometimes.

14:53.670 --> 14:55.920
We need to practice
and develop consistency.

14:56.330 --> 14:58.130
Uh, your clothes-

14:58.130 --> 15:00.790
Look, it's the price of her ability, okay?

15:00.790 --> 15:03.710
I swear... So indecent...

15:08.170 --> 15:09.630
Bring it on!

15:09.630 --> 15:13.330
I'll master this technique so I can
put it to use again in the future!

15:14.790 --> 15:16.420
That's the spirit...

15:51.500 --> 15:54.420
<b>Exhibition Match!!</b>

16:04.580 --> 16:07.330
Today, we put our
team's excellence on display.

16:07.330 --> 16:09.080
We'll look good doing it, too.

16:09.080 --> 16:11.040
A stylish victory in the bag!

16:12.210 --> 16:14.500
The moment of truth is finally here!

16:14.790 --> 16:16.630
So, how do ya feel?

16:16.630 --> 16:18.380
I'm ready for anything.

16:18.380 --> 16:20.880
Plus, I'll be using an ability
that Yachiho's never seen before.

16:20.880 --> 16:22.040
I feel good.

16:22.040 --> 16:24.170
But once the exibition match is over,

16:24.170 --> 16:27.080
the Himarin-Yukki duo
goes their separate ways, right?

16:27.080 --> 16:28.500
I guess so...

16:28.500 --> 16:31.330
He belongs to the commander, not me.

16:31.330 --> 16:33.830
And it's a physically demanding ability...

16:35.000 --> 16:37.130
For now, let's focus on today.

16:37.130 --> 16:39.960
The whole Demon Defense Force
will know who won.

16:40.250 --> 16:41.960
And the outcome
will affect our squadron's...

16:41.960 --> 16:44.130
the commander's reputation.

16:44.670 --> 16:47.170
We gotta put our best foot forward!

16:47.170 --> 16:48.040
Exactly.

16:48.040 --> 16:52.290
For myself... and for the commander
since she organized this match.

16:52.290 --> 16:53.630
I can't lose!

16:53.630 --> 16:54.670
That reminds me.

16:54.670 --> 16:57.750
Aren't other members of the
6th Squadron supposed to show up, too?

17:01.460 --> 17:02.790
Yoo-hoo!

17:02.790 --> 17:06.080
We got here early, so I came to de-stress!

17:06.080 --> 17:08.580
Since when was SHE in the 6th Squadron?!

17:08.580 --> 17:10.250
That's Sahara Wakasa.

17:10.500 --> 17:13.750
She's a homebody,
so it's rare to see her out and about.

17:14.040 --> 17:16.540
Zzzzz...

17:16.540 --> 17:19.000
<b>SAHARA WAKASA</b>

17:18.670 --> 17:20.920
And now she's asleep? How funny!

17:20.920 --> 17:23.210
She's certainly got guts, doesn't she?

17:28.130 --> 17:29.670
Go ahead without me.

17:29.670 --> 17:32.040
You'll do great, Himarin. Don't sweat it!

17:32.540 --> 17:34.920
Taking a bath before the exhibition match?

17:34.920 --> 17:37.330
You must be awfully confident.

17:38.330 --> 17:41.630
I intend to be clean and tidy
when I win today.

17:41.630 --> 17:42.710
Oh?

17:42.710 --> 17:45.130
Sounds like you've got a plan in mind.

17:45.130 --> 17:48.540
But the question is,
can you actually pull it off?

17:49.210 --> 17:50.540
<b>PASS WITH</b>

17:49.210 --> 17:50.540
<b>FLYING COLORS</b>

17:57.130 --> 17:58.920
O-of course I can!

18:00.460 --> 18:02.380
You still haven't left the dorm?

18:02.380 --> 18:04.500
The match is supposed to start soon.

18:04.500 --> 18:06.790
You're only delaying the inevitable.

18:10.790 --> 18:12.290
It'll be okay!

18:12.790 --> 18:15.500
We trained our asses off, remember?

18:18.080 --> 18:20.040
So cocky for a slave...

18:20.040 --> 18:20.960
Huh?

18:22.210 --> 18:25.080
Uh, obviously!
We're guaranteed to win!

18:31.080 --> 18:33.330
Sorry we're late, everyone!

18:34.250 --> 18:35.460
Write your name down.

18:35.670 --> 18:37.170
What's this for?

18:37.170 --> 18:39.920
It's used to trigger
Ginna Bizen's ability.

18:39.920 --> 18:44.380
She can create a barrier by drawing a line
on the ground that acts as a boundary.

18:44.380 --> 18:48.330
Only those who sign their names
can enter the barrier.

18:48.330 --> 18:49.880
<b>Himari</b>

18:48.330 --> 18:49.880
<b>Yuuki</b>

18:48.340 --> 18:52.750
Also, any damage sustained during combat
inside the barrier will be healed.

18:48.340 --> 18:49.880
<b>Tenka</b>

18:53.290 --> 18:54.670
Thanks for your patience!

18:54.670 --> 18:56.540
I'm Ginna Bizen of the 10th Squadron,

18:56.540 --> 19:00.790
and I'll be your referee for
today's intersquad exhibition match!

19:00.790 --> 19:02.710
<b>GINNA BIZEN</b>

19:02.750 --> 19:04.210
Ginna's Club!

19:09.630 --> 19:11.540
<b>MEMBERS ONLY FIGHTING ARENA</b>

19:12.000 --> 19:15.210
This ability of mine
is like a dream come true!

19:15.210 --> 19:18.040
I get to see the Demon Defense Force
up close and personal!

19:18.040 --> 19:19.130
Not everyone believes

19:19.130 --> 19:23.250
Peaches grant powers based on the person's
nature and knowledge, but I totally do!

19:24.290 --> 19:27.460
This barrier could withstand
the force of a thousand Shuuki.

19:27.460 --> 19:29.670
We're counting on you to judge this fight.

19:30.790 --> 19:33.040
Of course, Lady Ten!
Of course, Lady Kyou!

19:33.040 --> 19:35.130
I'll totally give it my best shot!

19:35.130 --> 19:36.880
"Lady Kyou"...?

19:36.880 --> 19:38.580
You're a Demon Defense Force fangirl?

19:38.790 --> 19:39.710
'Scuse me?

19:40.580 --> 19:43.040
Should've known she wouldn't like men...

19:43.040 --> 19:45.130
'Kay, I'm all set!

19:43.290 --> 19:45.750
<b>7th Squadron</b>

19:43.290 --> 19:45.750
<b>SHUSHU SURUGA</b>

19:45.750 --> 19:51.830
<b>KYOUKA UZEN</b>

19:45.750 --> 19:51.830
<b>HIMARI AZUMA</b>

19:46.000 --> 19:47.580
Did you make that?

19:47.580 --> 19:49.630
Nei counts as a non-combatant,

19:49.630 --> 19:51.880
so her job is to cheer on her teammates!

19:51.880 --> 19:53.500
First up in Round 1:

19:53.500 --> 19:56.380
It's Himari Azuma of the 7th Squadron

19:56.380 --> 19:59.000
versus Yachiho Azuma of the 6th Squadron!

19:59.000 --> 20:02.790
The rules are, whoever gives up
or gets knocked out first loses!

20:03.420 --> 20:06.250
Injuries will be healed,
so don't hesitate to go nuts!

20:06.670 --> 20:10.420
Once I win this match,
I'm going to drag you back home.

20:10.420 --> 20:12.750
You'll be my special little servant.

20:20.170 --> 20:22.830
I'm not the same person I was back then...

20:23.500 --> 20:25.710
I WILL win, Yachiho.

20:35.500 --> 20:36.830
<b>7th Squadron</b>

20:36.880 --> 20:40.210
As part of my ability,
he's going to assist me.

20:40.210 --> 20:41.250
Fine by me.

20:41.250 --> 20:44.830
Denying a dog handler her dog
is just plain heartless.

20:44.830 --> 20:46.290
Is everyone ready?

20:47.750 --> 20:49.710
Now then, let the first match...

20:50.750 --> 20:52.250
begin!

20:52.250 --> 20:54.130
I'm warning you, Himari.

20:54.130 --> 20:56.000
You won't last a second against-

20:57.920 --> 20:59.210
<b>BRAND BREAK!</b>

20:59.250 --> 21:02.540
Where in the hell did THAT come from?!

21:04.210 --> 21:06.040
Golden Hour!

21:06.040 --> 21:07.500
Rewind 5 seconds!

21:06.290 --> 21:07.460
<b>AZUMA TIME: GOLDEN HOUR</b>

21:08.710 --> 21:09.250
<b>BRAND BREAK!</b>

21:12.710 --> 21:14.250
...begin!

21:15.290 --> 21:16.670
She's tired...

21:16.670 --> 21:19.460
We planned ahead in case we couldn't
finish her off with a single blow!

21:19.460 --> 21:21.130
Let's stick to our strategy!

21:21.920 --> 21:23.880
She changed tactics.

21:23.880 --> 21:26.290
Now to figure out whether it was
an accident or on purpose...

21:26.290 --> 21:31.380
Himari, you haven't realized my
ability has gotten stronger, have you?

21:31.380 --> 21:35.080
It's an indisputable fact that
little sisters can't beat big sisters...

21:35.380 --> 21:38.460
I'll prove it to you with "Prime Time"!

23:11.000 --> 23:13.580
<b>TEACH US! NEI-SENPAI!</b>

23:11.380 --> 23:12.960
"Teach Us! Nei-senpai!"

23:12.960 --> 23:13.790
Okey-dokey!

23:13.580 --> 23:16.210
<b>LOFTY AMBITIONS: LEARNING</b>

23:13.790 --> 23:16.580
Today we're talking about
Miss Himari's ability: Learning!

23:16.580 --> 23:18.460
It's a phenomenal power
that allows Miss Himari to adopt

23:18.460 --> 23:20.500
someone else's ability by
selecting their data on her phone,

23:20.500 --> 23:22.630
so long as she's seen said ability.

23:22.630 --> 23:24.080
But then there's the issue
of compatibility,

23:24.080 --> 23:25.630
plus the quality of the
ability deteriorates...

23:25.630 --> 23:27.460
Using an ability that comes with a price

23:27.460 --> 23:30.580
requires that price to be paid or
she can't switch it for a different one,

23:30.580 --> 23:33.420
so she must study the characteristics
of abilities to use them fully.

23:33.420 --> 23:36.080
It's the perfect ability for a hardworking
person like Miss Himari!

23:36.380 --> 23:37.500
Anyways, next time:

23:37.500 --> 23:39.250
"Sisters, Yachiho, Ridicule"

23:37.500 --> 23:40.960
<b>SISTERS,</b>

23:37.500 --> 23:40.960
<b>YACHIHO,</b>

23:37.500 --> 23:40.960
<b>RIDICULE</b>

23:39.250 --> 23:40.540
Thanks for watching!
